cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "autoforge: trustworthy self-made tools for agents"
abstract: "An agent framework in which tools are created freely but must earn trust: an independent validity gate and non-gameable fitness take the fitness definition and the oracle out of the tested tool's hands. Clean A/B/C ablation on a real model holds tool intactness at 3/3 with the gate on and rots to 0/3 within four generations with it off."
authors:
